# MIS SARL — Add Optional Brand Text and Product/Brand Images to Quotation Lines

Act as a senior Next.js engineer, TypeScript developer, PostgreSQL specialist, Vercel Blob integration specialist, and PDF generation engineer.

You are working on the existing MIS SARL business management application.

Your task is to extend the existing quotation creation and editing workflow so that each quotation line can optionally contain:

1. A manually editable brand name.
2. An optional uploaded image, which can be a brand logo or a product photograph.
3. Both brand name and image.
4. Neither, when the client does not require brand information.

This is a deliberately simple feature.

**Do not create a brand library, brand image management module, new catalogue category, or a separate product image management system.**

The brand name and image belong directly to the individual quotation line. They are specific to the commercial document being prepared.

I have already created a PUBLIC Vercel Blob store called:

`missarl-quotation-images`

The repository already contains:

`@vercel/blob`: `^2.9.0`

Use this existing package and existing Blob store. Do not create another storage provider or another Blob store.

I am also providing the reference quotation PDF:

`RFQ-CHEMAF-2000002358 OQ.pdf`

This PDF is the visual reference for the BRAND column.

